    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/aae2ffeacad1768a6593e2b644de05f5.avif?t=1754558445\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack 'N' Slash Action RPG in a Steampunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a convict who has been thrown into the dungeons by a powerful ruling organization. Embark on a journey through a world devastated by a mysterious asteroid, scattering powerful crystal shards across distinct world zones brimming with mutated creatures and steampunk enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into post-apocalyptic dungeons that randomize upon each visit and ascend to new heights of power with epic loot, extensive talent tree progression, theorycrafting and lootable skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIMAL HYBRID HEROES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between powerful hybrid animal characters with unique skills and talent trees.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTENSIVE TALENT TREE PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your path to mastery with an expanding tree of talents. Gain experience and unlock new powers to form synergies with your items and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOTABLE SKILLS WITH RANDOMIZED SKILL TREES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a treasure trove of skills in different rarities. Unlock your path of choice through procedurally generated skill trees and master your style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP ITEMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, craft and modify your items. Meet other players, create guilds, and trade items with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons offer new thrilling adventures and challenges, as the catastrophic Nexus strikes the world, wiping out the memories and possessions of all characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singleplayer or multiplayer as you delve into dungeons in search of challenges and rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/aae2ffeacad1768a6593e2b644de05f5.avif?t=1754558445\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hack 'N' Slash Action RPG in a Steampunk World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a convict who has been thrown into the dungeons by a powerful ruling organization. Embark on a journey through a world devastated by a mysterious asteroid, scattering powerful crystal shards across distinct world zones brimming with mutated creatures and steampunk enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into post-apocalyptic dungeons that randomize upon each visit and ascend to new heights of power with epic loot, extensive talent tree progression, theorycrafting and lootable skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/e7bcf16fe125d71cc9cfbcc892508146.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANIMAL HYBRID HEROES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between powerful hybrid animal characters with unique skills and talent trees.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTENSIVE TALENT TREE PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on your path to mastery with an expanding tree of talents. Gain experience and unlock new powers to form synergies with your items and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/cdaad740839d979de971800ac861af97.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOTABLE SKILLS WITH RANDOMIZED SKILL TREES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a treasure trove of skills in different rarities. Unlock your path of choice through procedurally generated skill trees and master your style of play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.poster.avif?t=1754558445\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.webm?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2574970/extras/d1de644f0ce35efe83dd91921654e54e.mp4?t=1754558445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP ITEMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot, craft and modify your items. Meet other players, create guilds, and trade items with your friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasons offer new thrilling adventures and challenges, as the catastrophic Nexus strikes the world, wiping out the memories and possessions of all characters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singleplayer or multiplayer as you delve into dungeons in search of challenges and rewards.</p>",
